{
  "_readme": [
    "Fingerprints of the reference splits. The repo ships no manifests: 「감성 및 발화 스타일별 음성합성 데이터」",
    "terms forbid redistributing the data or derivatives. Regenerate the manifests",
    "from your own approved copy of the dataset, then verify with:",
    "  uv run python -m scripts.split_fingerprint --manifest-dir data/manifests \\",
    "      --data-root <dataset root> --check data/SPLIT_CHECKSUMS.json",
    "Matching hashes mean you hold the identical split and your numbers are",
    "directly comparable to the published ones."
  ],
  "hash": "sha256 over sorted '<relpath>\\t<label>' lines; relpath is relative to the dataset root",
  "generator": {
    "manifest": "python -m scripts.build_manifest",
    "split": "python -m scripts.make_disjoint_split --seed 42",
    "seed": 42,
    "note": "build_manifest walks the dataset in sorted() order and make_disjoint_split uses random.Random(seed), so regeneration is deterministic."
  },
  "label_space": {
    "0": "happy",
    "1": "sad",
    "2": "angry",
    "3": "anxious",
    "4": "hurt",
    "5": "embarrassed",
    "6": "neutral"
  },
  "configs": {
    "4class": {
      "keep_labels": [
        0,
        1,
        2,
        6
      ],
      "manifest_dir": "data/manifests",
      "config": "configs/default.yaml",
      "splits": {
        "train_di": {
          "n": 190837,
          "sha256": "1a121110165371c77ab4ce208e9260e8d34a44c7e8e6cf8f22b17f11955905a5",
